<addAttributes>
    <att name='institution'>Hakai Institute</att>
    <att name='title'>Bathymetric Survey of the Fraser River - 2023</att>
    <att name='summary'>Between 2022 and 2023, a number of multibeam surveys were performed in the Fraser River in order to characterize the riverbed. Of particular interest was the morphology of canyon walls along the river. The collected data were then used to assess landslide risk along the river, and to select areas where repeat surveys / monitoring could be done.</att>
    <att name='project'>Geospatial</att>
    <att name='comment'>##Limitations:
Not to be used for navigational purposes</att>
    <att name='progress'>completed</att>
